MindForge Cross-Framework Crosswalk — original analysis.

The mappings in mindforge-crosswalk.json are original AI Governance Platform
(AIGP) analysis of control-intent correspondence between MindForge practices and
controls in NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 42001, FINOS AIGF, and the EU AI Act. They are
NOT an official mapping by, or endorsement from, MAS/ABS, NIST, ISO, FINOS, or
the European Commission. Practice and control codes are factual identifiers.
"note" fields are original AIGP wording; no normative text is reproduced.